# Copy to .env and fill in as needed. .env is gitignored.
#
# In the normal setup this file is empty and the router holds no secret at all: the credential
# arriving from Claude Code is forwarded to Anthropic as-is, and stripped before requests go to
# LM Studio. See docs/procedures/anthropic-auth-check.md in the project repository for why.
#
# Only needed if a backend in config.yaml names an `api_key_env`. For example, if LM Studio's
# "Require Authentication" is switched on:
#
# LMSTUDIO_API_KEY=
